
=== the job is on disk before the write returns, and outlives a failure
  put manifest one [c0]
  owed the moment the put returned: 1
  owed once caught up: 0 (target refused 1, degraded false)
--- target
  chunk c0
  manifest one

=== a failure that cannot clear is dropped, and the target says so
  put manifest two [c0]
  owed: 0 (degraded true — needs tsync mirror)

=== a target that was down the whole time a process ran
  put chunk c2, put manifest three [c2], copy three -> four, delete three
  owed with the target unreachable: 3
  on the target so far: 0 key(s)

=== the next daemon start picks up what it left owed
  owed before the start: 3
  put chunk c2 and manifest five while stopped: owed 4, held in memory 0, told 1, on the target 0 key(s)
  owed once caught up: 0
--- target
  chunk c2
  manifest five
  manifest four

=== a replica carries the sync bookkeeping too
  put journal entry, put cursor
--- target
  cursor
  journal

=== a manifest job part way through its chunks says how far it has got
  put manifest six [c4, c6, c8], the target holding c6
  filling while held: big.mov, 1/3 checked, 1 sent (4 bytes)
  filling once caught up: nothing
--- target
  chunk c4
  chunk c6
  chunk c8
  manifest six

=== the mains are what a write waits for
  manifest one on main: true
  manifest two on main, though its target dropped it: true
